    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE FISCAL MANAGEMENT (RESPONSIBILITY)ACT, NO. 3 OF 2003",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      268.01,
      401.91,
      292.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      306.17,
      401.88,
      341.51
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Fiscal Management(Responsibility) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2021 and shallbe deemed to have come into operation on January 1, 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      354.17,
      401.89,
      377.51
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the Fiscal Management (Responsibility)Act, No. 3 of 2003 is hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      182.97,
      390.17,
      401.86,
      425.51
    ],
    "text": "(a) in paragraph (e) of that section, by the substitution,for the words \u201cten per centum;\u201d of the words \u201cfifteenper centum;\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      182.97,
      438.17,
      401.86,
      473.51
    ],
    "text": "(b) in paragraph (f) of that section, by the substitution,for the words and figures \u201cJanuary 1, 2020\u201d of thewords and figures \u201c January 1, 2030\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      486.17,
      401.9,
      509.51
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
